"We laid out every benefit clearly, so you can compare tiers and choose the "
"membership that suits you best."
msgstr ""

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.products_oe_structure_2
msgid ""
"We offer distinct membership tiers, each designed around how often and how "
"deeply you want to experience the club."
msgstr ""

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.products_oe_structure_2
